    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Churches Estate Agents bring an elevate open plot of ground, c 0.9 acre to the market and an excellent opportunity for anyone looking to build a home or invest in a peaceful countryside setting.  \r\n\r\nSituated in a scenic rural location with beautiful surrounding views of the rolling mountains this plot combines privacy and tranquility while still being within easy reach of nearby towns and local amenities. The property has strong potential for development subject to the necessary planning permission and would suit those seeking a quiet lifestyle in one of Wicklow’s most attractive areas. Plot has mains services available to include main water and sewerage.\r\n\r\nCoolboy in South Wicklow, the Garden of Ireland, is conveniently located off the M11, it is approx. 2km from the busting & thriving commuter town of Arklow. Here is the village you are treated to schools, shops, restaurants, pubs & sporting clubs. Arklow Town has a harbour and features many amenities for modern day busy living to include shopping centre, cafes, parks, boutiques, schools, train station, hotels and numerous sporting and leisure activities.  Commuting is at an ease with heading north the M50 motorway is approx. 45 mins away. Heading south is the town of Gorey, c. 21km with a wealth of further shopping services & local business. \r\n\r\nThe plot of ground falls under Level 7 of the Wicklow Development Plan 2022- 2028. \r\n\r\nViewing is by appointment only."
      },
      {
